0/extras/ffb97857bb783fbf938bbf7911f069d4.mp4?t=1788558262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime buoyancy simulation even considering ocean waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various armor thicknesses and accurate penetration calculation based on speed, mass and angle of incidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ballistic trajectories even considering changes in the air pressure with altitude. Speeds and distances are however reduced to increase the nervosity of combats (in reality it would take more than a minute to hit a target at 20km).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable ballasts for submarine designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based damages instead of healthbars. Turrets and engines will also lose performance if hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather system and day cycles, including changes in ocean waves amplitude and rain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign with more than 50 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 different ships to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom battle editor, including weather, time of day selection, and bots vs bots naval battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual and automatic control mode for weaponery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime fluid simulation (experimental).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit your ship in first person view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raytracing renderer to generate your most beautiful screenshots !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially supported modding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it