oin the discord to post your creations or simply talk about WWII ships and connect with the community !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854870/extras/316afffdff8bc38d608c921438fc75c5.avif?t=1788558262\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p>",
